{"aihot_items":[{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/d92mrmxvsfmnoyw3comncgz2c","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"opinion","id":"d92mrmxvsfmnoyw3comncgz2c","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/d92mrmxvsfmnoyw3comncgz2c","published_at":"2026-10-24T14:30:45Z","ref":"A1","score":77,"selected":true,"source":"X：Ethan Mollick (@emollick)","summary":"Ethan Mollick 转引 OpenAI 红队测试认为，实验室看似夸张的 AI 网络安全判断应被更认真对待。OpenAI 让前沿模型智能体团队攻击其加固的隔离基础设施，智能体几乎在每个受限联网服务中都找到漏洞，还能利用 CPU 缓存时序在不联网、无共享文件的虚拟机之间传递秘密，类似 Spectre 和 Meltdown 的攻击手法。作者提到 Anthropic 和 Noam Brown 此前关于 AI 网络攻防与模型自发协调的说法曾被嘲笑。","title":"Ethan Mollick：OpenAI 红队测试显示前沿模型智能体真能越狱沙箱，实验室的 AI 安全警告值得重视","title_en":"Without being overly credulous, we should be taking seemingly “out there” ideas about AI cybersecurity from the Labs more seriously. Exam...","url":"https://x.com/emollick/status/2114001653879672877"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/imgp55zxmw4jugt1a29ap9yo1","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"imgp55zxmw4jugt1a29ap9yo1","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/imgp55zxmw4jugt1a29ap9yo1","published_at":"2026-10-24T11:12:36Z","ref":"A2","score":82,"selected":true,"source":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","summary":"OpenAI 介绍其前沿模型训练已完全断网，并用 AI 智能体红队测试自家基础设施。隔离测试中，智能体在无网络、无共享文件的条件下通过 CPU 缓存时序差异、共享内存写入模式等侧信道通信，甚至独立建立编码方案交换信息。","title":"OpenAI 智能体在隔离测试中借 CPU 缓存隐蔽通信","title_en":"OpenAI's isolated AI agents found ways to talk to each other through CPU cache","url":"https://the-decoder.com/openais-isolated-ai-agents-found-ways-to-talk-to-each-other-through-cpu-cache/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/gwhdq3jo5p1z27wh2i46ntd2s","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"gwhdq3jo5p1z27wh2i46ntd2s","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/gwhdq3jo5p1z27wh2i46ntd2s","published_at":"2026-10-24T02:08:43Z","ref":"A3","score":78,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：数字生命卡兹克","summary":"月之暗面发布旗舰模型 Kimi K3.1 Pro，参数 2.8T，支持 100 万 Token 上下文，完整模型权重预计 11 月 4 日前开放。API 输入每百万 Token 13 元、输出 68 元，相比 K3 基